{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Angel\n👼 Central figure of the Prophecy and of Hometown's religion — according to the text, you must \"banish its Heaven\" to save both worlds.","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":170,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":0,"y":-220,"width":260,"height":147},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Prophecy**\nThe \"Angel's Heaven\" that must be banished is one of the text's most direct connections to this figure.","x":-650,"y":300,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":-650,"y":90,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Alvin**\nFirmly believes in the faith and the Prophecy, and treats the Angel with genuine religious respect — prays for its guidance.","x":-300,"y":300,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Alvin_overwolrd.webp","x":-300,"y":90,"width":96,"height":180},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nHas kept a worn pair of angel wings since childhood, from the Christmas play — and a clock from a real ARG points to her as a candidate to be the Angel herself.","x":60,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":60,"y":90,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei**\nHe's the one who most repeats the idea of the Angel as part of the \"script\" — but even he doesn't seem sure what his tapestry represents.","x":420,"y":300,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png","x":420,"y":90,"width":95,"height":180},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Player**\nIs the Angel a narrative personification of whoever controls Kris from outside the fiction? The most widespread theory in the whole fandom.","x":780,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_SOUL.png","x":780,"y":90,"width":97,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e_c_img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e0i","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e1i","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e2i","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e3i","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e4i","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_prophecy_ralsei","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_alvin_prophecy","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_noelle_jugador","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_ralsei_jugador","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}